# GRC canonical corpus — verbatim byte-exact copies.
# Disable EOL/text normalization so committed blobs stay byte-identical to their
# tmp/ sources and match the sha256 recorded in source_digest_manifest.v0.1.yaml.
# (Repo core.autocrlf=input would otherwise rewrite CRLF->LF at commit time,
#  desyncing 6 CRLF sources from their recorded digest.)
normalized/** -text
